"""Episode 16 (Year 1770) polygons, used by world_data_1740 and world_data_1770 (and Ep 17).
1642 -> 1740: the Qing take China (1644-83), Taiwan (1683), Khalkha Mongolia (1691) and Tibet (1720); Russia takes left-bank Ukraine,
Kiev and Smolensk (1667), Kamchatka (c.1700) and Estonia-Livonia-Ingria (Nystad 1721); the Habsburgs take Hungary and Transylvania
(Karlowitz 1699) and northern Serbia (1718-39); Brandenburg-Prussia (kingdom 1701); Great Britain (1707) with thirteen colonies
(Georgia 1732-33), Jamaica, Newfoundland, Nova Scotia and Hudson Bay; New France on the St Lawrence and down the Mississippi;
Portuguese Brazil back from the Dutch (1654); Dutch Cape Colony (1652) and Ceylon (1658); the Mughals shrinking before the
Marathas; Nader Shah's Afsharid Persia (1736) with Afghanistan; the Dzungar Khanate.
1740 -> 1770: Prussia takes Silesia (1742); Britain wins Canada, Florida and everything east of the Mississippi (1763) and the
diwani of Bengal (1765); Spain gets Louisiana (1762) and reaches California (1769); Brazil pushed west (Madrid 1750); the Qing
destroy the Dzungars (1755-59) and take Xinjiang; the Durrani Empire (1747); Zand Persia; Maratha Confederacy, Hyderabad,
Mysore and Awadh in India; Corsica to France (1768)."""
